Package: docbake
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-file Markdown documentation compiler
 Compiles multi-file Markdown documentation into single-page HTML,
 multi-page HTML, or PDF (via Typst). Supports include directives,
 heading ID assignment, link rewriting, footnote collection, syntax
 highlighting, and diagram rendering.
